--  Configuration pragmas for the whole Posture partition.
--
--  pragma Profile (Ravenscar) is a partition-wide configuration pragma
--  (not a per-package one) -- it belongs in gnat.adc, picked up
--  automatically by gprbuild/gnatmake when building from this
--  directory, per standard GNAT convention. It restricts tasking to the
--  Ravenscar-compliant subset (no dynamic task creation, no
--  Select/Abort, Ceiling_Locking for protected objects, etc.) -- this
--  module has no `task` declarations at all, only the one `protected`
--  object in Posture.Machine, which the profile fully supports.
pragma Profile (Ravenscar);

--  Ravenscar requires an explicit ceiling priority policy; GNAT infers a
--  correct default for a protected object with no tasks calling it at
--  differing priorities, but stating it explicitly here documents the
--  choice rather than leaving it implicit.
pragma Locking_Policy (Ceiling_Locking);
